\n\\nSo I'll choose Play B5.  \\n\\nReason: B5 is an isolated middle tile with poor connectivity to my other tiles, while keeping W6, W8, W9 maintains potential for W suit Chows if I draw W7, and retaining T4,T5,T6 provides a ready Chow. Discarding B5 is relatively safe as it hasn't been prominently discarded, but it's a reasonable sacrifice to improve hand shape.  \\n\\nAnswer: Play B5\"}"}
